  "header": "Policies",
  "content": "The Policies v2 API does not use the same authentication and request signing detailed\nearlier in this document. Our Python, Go, Java, and Node.JS API clients have been\nupdated with the new authentication and signing requirements and include support for\nthe Policies v2 API endpoints. We recommend you use the duo_client_python Python\nAPI client, the duo_api_golang Go API client, the duo_client_java Java API client, or the\nduo_api_nodejs Node.JS API client to interact with the Policies endpoints.",
